# Potassium, Chloride, Carbon dioxide, GFR, Urine Glucose, Bilirubin, Ketones,
# Specific gravity, pH, Protein, HbA1c, Height, Pain severity, Weight,
# BMI, Heart rate, Respiratory rate, Blood Glucose, Blood Urea nitrogen,
# Blood Creatinine, Blood Calcium, Blood Sodium, Blood Potassium, Blood Chloride,
